      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7475834::chunk::000::abstract::d1ff4579e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will protect the surface without altering the alloy's bulk microstructure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will not compromise the alloy's inherent ductility or yield strength.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated alloy will retain useful mechanical performance during or after exposure to air at 1000 °C for up to 100 hours.",
